date and cancelled, then ran standard update again, a	save of the Finder and Start are appended to the end of the	script a second and then a third and then a fourth time and so on.	Standard Update resource was being loaded and its handle	increased in size.  The next time it was loaded it was already	in memory so LoadResource returned the already-enlarged handle.	Fix was to get the original size and save it; then after calling	LoadResource, if there's a saved value, use it to SetHandleSize.; 20 Mar 91 V2.0d41	Part of system 6.0d29 release.; - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -22 Mar 91	Main.asm: ScriptListSub: optimize.  (Sets controls based	on scripts selected.)25 Mar 91	Main.asm: ScriptListSub:  Optimize.	Remove redundant code in REMOVE button section.	Remove code redundant with CheckScript.	Dim Install button if PreventBoot flag set & 	VolStr (boot volume) = CurrentVol (current volume).	WS# MS437INS: Fixed: turn on Install button on transition	from no scripts to some scripts.	Subroutines.asm: Check4Scripts: (builds list of scriptNames	and flags for each script):	convert flags to new symbols in Installer.Equates (bDirReq,	bNoRemove, bPreventBoot); add bPreventBoot flag coding.	MainSub.asm: removed InstallRemove & SetRemoveControl: not in use.	MainSub.asm: optimized RemoveControlOn / Off by calling RemoveControl.26 Mar 91	MainSub.asm: removed RemoveControl: not in use.	Removed redundant RemoveControlOn / Off.	Fixed logic errors in Install and Remove.	Added logic to SetInstallRemove to check for bPreventBoot bit	in InstallRemoveMode and to check for boot volume.	Generally rewrote all of Install/Remove button subsystem.27 Mar 91	Changed routine names from ListWindow2Sub to FolderListSub,	and from ListWindowSub to ScriptListSub.		Continued rewrite of Install/Remove button subsystem.	Implemented BootVolTest: check if target volume is Boot volume.	Added Talking Head alert message: 'One or 